# Course starter assets (Synty Studios / Unity, not for redistribution)
**/Assets/Course Library/
**/Assets/Course Library.meta

# Unity-provided resources that can be re-imported
**/Assets/TextMesh Pro/
**/Assets/TextMesh Pro.meta

# Baked lighting (regenerated in the editor)
**/Assets/Scenes/*/LightingData.asset
**/Assets/Scenes/*/LightingData.asset.meta
**/Assets/Scenes/*/ReflectionProbe-*.exr
**/Assets/Scenes/*/ReflectionProbe-*.exr.meta

# Unity template boilerplate
**/Assets/TutorialInfo/
**/Assets/TutorialInfo.meta
**/Assets/Readme.asset
**/Assets/Readme.asset.meta

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
